---
const waHref = "https://wa.me/34653039281?text=Hola%2C%20quiero%20un%20diagn%C3%B3stico%20gratis%20de%20mi%20web%2Fapp%20hecha%20con%20IA";
import HectorStandWhiteShirt from '../../assets/content/hector-stand-white-shirt.png'
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
---
<section class="cs-section-tight">
  <div class="cs-wrap">
    <div class="cs-final-cta cs-reveal">
      <span class="cs-final-cta-photo" aria-hidden="true">
        <Image
          class="cs-final-cta-photo-image"
          src={HectorStandWhiteShirt}
          alt=""
          loading="lazy"
          width="120"
          height="120"
        />
      </span>
      <h2>¿Le echamos un vistazo a tu proyecto?</h2>
      <p>Cuéntame qué tienes y qué te preocupa. El diagnóstico es gratis y no te compromete a nada.</p>
      <a class="cs-btn cs-btn-primary" href={waHref} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Escríbeme por WhatsApp</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cs-final-cta{background:var(--ink);border-radius:24px;padding:64px 40px;text-align:center;color:var(--on-ink);}
  @media (max-width:640px){.cs-final-cta{padding:44px 22px;}}
  .cs-final-cta-photo{
    width:92px;height:92px;border-radius:50%;overflow:hidden;
    margin:0 auto 22px;display:block;position:relative;
    border:2px solid var(--ink-line);background:var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .cs-final-cta-photo-image{
    width:120px;height:120px;max-width:none !important;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 23%;
    transform:scale(1.05);
  }
  .cs-final-cta h2{color:var(--on-ink);max-width:600px;margin:0 auto 16px;}
  .cs-final-cta p{color:var(--text-muted-on-ink);max-width:480px;margin:0 auto 30px;font-size:16px;}
</style>
